#. Error when a device tries to rename a name it is not holding.
#: routes/singers_api.py:114
msgid "You can only change your own name"
msgstr "只能修改自己的名字"

#. Error when renaming onto a name that already belongs to someone else.
#: routes/singers_api.py:120
msgid "That name is already taken"
msgstr "這個名字已經有人用了"

#. Error when renaming to or from a reserved system name.
#. Error when merging a reserved system name.
#: routes/singers_api.py:123 routes/singers_api.py:161
