msgstr "找不到這位演唱者"

#: routes/splash.py:26
msgid "Never sing again... ever."
msgstr "拜託...以後別再唱了。"

#: routes/splash.py:27
msgid "That was a really good impression of a dying cat!"
msgstr "這模仿貓叫也太像了吧！"

#: routes/splash.py:28
msgid "Thank God it's over."
msgstr "謝天謝地，終於唱完了。"

#: routes/splash.py:29
msgid "Pass the mic, please!"
msgstr "麥克風請交給下一位！"

#: routes/splash.py:30
msgid "Well, I'm sure you're very good at your day job."
msgstr "嗯...你的本業一定很厲害。"

#: routes/splash.py:33
msgid "I've seen better."
msgstr "我聽過更好的。"

#: routes/splash.py:34
msgid "Ok... just ok."
msgstr "還行...就還行。"

#: routes/splash.py:35
msgid "Not bad for an amateur."
msgstr "以業餘來說還不錯。"

#: routes/splash.py:36
msgid "You put on a decent show."
msgstr "唱得挺不錯的喔！"

#: routes/splash.py:37
msgid "That was... something."
msgstr "這個嘛...很有特色。"

#: routes/splash.py:40
msgid "Congratulations! That was unbelievable!"
msgstr "恭喜！太不可思議了！"

#: routes/splash.py:41
msgid "Wow, have you tried auditioning for The Voice?"
msgstr "哇，要不要去報名《聲林之王》？"

#: routes/splash.py:42
msgid "Please, sing another one!"
msgstr "安可！再來一首！"

#: routes/splash.py:43
msgid "You rock! You know that?!"
msgstr "你超強的，你知道嗎？！"

#: routes/splash.py:44
msgid "Woah, who let Freddie Mercury in here?"
msgstr "哇，誰把佛萊迪・墨裘瑞請來了？"

#: routes/stream.py:280
msgid "Failed to stream subtitle: "
msgstr "字幕載入失敗："

#. Title of the identity dialog when a nameless device is joining in.
#: templates/base.html:42 templates/base.html:700 templates/base.html:703
msgid "Join in"
msgstr "加入"

#. Title of the identity dialog when an existing singer edits their profile.
#: templates/base.html:44
